---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: report
---
$ nabu new 42-empty-list-notice
exit 1
error: tablet "42-empty-list-notice" already exists at nabu/tablets/42-empty-list-notice
fix: pick another name, or work in the existing tablet

$ nabu new todo-reminders/reminder-delivery
exit 1
error: slice "reminder-delivery" already exists in tablet "todo-reminders" as 2-reminder-delivery
fix: pick another slice name

$ nabu new nope/first
exit 1
error: unknown tablet "nope"; existing tablets: 42-empty-list-notice, todo-reminders
fix: nabu new nope

$ nabu new 42-empty-list-notice/first
exit 1
error: tablet "42-empty-list-notice" is not stacked: nabu/tablets/42-empty-list-notice/stack.md is missing
fix: add nabu/tablets/42-empty-list-notice/stack.md

$ nabu new todo-reminders/first --stack
exit 1
error: --stack applies to a tablet, not to a slice
fix: nabu new todo-reminders/first
